        "body": "Each sum is odd, so each roll shows one odd and one even number. The odd number $k$ is in all three rolls, so the even partners are $5 - k$, $7 - k$ and $9 - k$, all between 1 and 6.\n\n- $k = 1$: partners 4, 6, 8 — but 8 is impossible.\n- $k = 5$: partners 0, 2, 4 — 0 is impossible.\n- $k = 3$: partners 2, 4, 6. ✓\n\nThe rolls were (3, 2), (3, 4), (3, 6). Of the options only (2, 3) appears.\n\n**Answer: (C) (2, 3)**"
